At that time Śakra Devānām Indra was there together with his attendants, twenty thousand sons of heaven.
Also Bright Moon Deva (or 明月天子), Universal Fragrance Deva, Universal Light Deva, and the Four Heavenly Kings were there together with their attendants, ten thousand sons of heaven;
Iśvara Deva and Maheśvara Deva were there together with their attendants, thirty thousand sons of heaven; and the lord of the sahā world, the Brahmā kings Śikhin Great Brahmā, Shining Great Brahmā, and the rest, were there together with their attendants, twelve thousand sons of heaven.

he preached this Lotus Sutra for a full sixty small kalpas, not rising from this seat, and this Dharma-teacher Wonderful Light was able to receive and keep all of the most subtle Dharma that was preached.
After the Buddha had preached this Lotus Sutra and made the living beings joyful and glad, on that very day he at once addressed the hosts of gods and humans.
The meaning of the true aspect of all dharmas I have already preached for you;

At this time the sons each said to their father:
Father, please now give us the fine toys you promised earlier, the goat carts, deer carts, and ox carts.
Śāriputra, at that time the elder gave to each of his sons one and the same great cart;
